OL,4,BFilming training by drones should be   
OL,5,Billegal - Iraola                       
OL,6,GLiverpool head coach Andoni Iraola     
OL,7,Gsays filming with drones around        
OL,8,Gtraining grounds should be illegal     
OL,9,Gafter Mauricio Pochettino's first      
OL,10,Gsession as Manchester United boss was  
OL,11,Gcaptured and uploaded online.          
OL,13,FPochettino and his players were        
OL,14,Fclearly visible in the footage, which  
OL,15,Fwas shot above United's Carrington     
OL,16,Ftraining base from a variety of angles 
OL,17,Fand distances.                         
